<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>When you need a reliable <strong>garage floor storm shelter in Sherman TX</strong>, Texoma Storm Shelters provides robust, discreet protection. These flush-mount units are installed directly into your garage concrete slab, offering immediate access to safety without taking up valuable floor space. They are designed for easy vehicle parking directly above the unit.</p><p>Our garage shelters meet strict FEMA P-320 and ICC-500 standards, ensuring you get the highest level of life-safety protection. We prioritize your family's safety with practical, certified solutions for severe weather. Our team is licensed, insured, and ready to provide a free written estimate.</p></div></div></section>
